35 four-faced dice with faces from 1 to 4 (each die shown by its faces).
A rotation of a non-transitive list is one too: each loop shows once per die in it.

Ordered lists of 3 non-transitive dice, each losing to the next and the first beating the last: 3
    1144 < 2224 (6 to 8), 2224 < 1333 (7 to 9), yet 1144 > 1333 (8 to 6)
