    1333 < 1144 (6 to 8), 1144 < 2224 (6 to 8), 2224 < 2233 (4 to 6), yet 1333 > 2233 (6 to 4)
    2224 < 2233 (4 to 6), 2233 < 1333 (4 to 6), 1333 < 1144 (6 to 8), yet 2224 > 1144 (8 to 6)
